('OR01','Coverage after disclosure limits','A hypothetical UK case is useful in aggregate, while a detailed identity-bearing contrast cannot be released; a buyer asks for a US-specific case.',['OC01','OC03'],'Keep eligible usable permitted analysis counted under WP03. Assess what the released material can support; aggregate context may be useful, while a US-specific case must remain unknown if absent. Do not invent detail or add a new case quota.',['No named-case requirement','No reduced complete contracted report'],['CLM-0526','CLM-0531']),
